# Literal values only; no shell expansion. An exported PENPOT_MCP_SERVER_URL takes precedence.
# Paste the server URL from Penpot's Your account > Integrations > MCP Server. It contains your MCP key, so keep the real .env owner-only and out of chat, logs and commits.
PENPOT_MCP_SERVER_URL=
# Optional setting reserved for separate REST tooling. The MCP connector does not consume this token or require it; preserve an existing value, but do not create one for MCP setup.
PENPOT_ACCESS_TOKEN=
